                            <comment id="165201" author="adilger" created="Wed, 7 Sep 2016 20:57:34 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Note that this same interface could also be used to specify the ZFS compression type and level on a per-file basis as well. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="497419" author="adilger" created="Tue, 7 Jul 2026 21:48:28 +0000">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;tt&gt;lfs ladvise blocksize&lt;/tt&gt; could also be useful for specifying the folio size for ldiskfs (both on the client and server).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
